Flow urn.openbanking.psd2.sca
     Basepath ""
     Inputs consent_id redirect_uri
// Flow starting
Log "@info Start executing Openbanking flow"
// Feedback message
feedback = {}
// Max repeate
Repeat 3 times max
     // Agama Consent Service 
     Call org.gluu.agama.user.AgamaConsentService#getInstance 